{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>俞可程（Kanis）日前在社交平台分享了一組宅家日常的花絮靚相，大方以清爽又性感的家居 Look 亮相，親手下廚炮製健康美食。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_259fbd53dfbcc898-1192\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>相中可見，置身家中廚房的俞可程身穿一襲灰色蕾絲邊深V吊帶背心，搭配天藍色家居超短褲，整體造型既簡約隨性，又充滿夏日清爽氣息。俞可程隨意將頭髮紮起，隨後親自於廚房準備豐富餐點，包括將麵包、火腿片、新鮮青葡萄、牛油果及雞蛋等健康食材用心擺盤，展現出賢惠又懂享受生活的一面。她隨後在社交平台簡潔留言：「Today’s meal 🍽️」，分享這份充滿儀式感的健康輕食日常。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_259fbd53dfbcc898-1192\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7ad33b03-66ea-494b-be70-9b076d0dd0c9.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026qNRBA4V0GO1789634695.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7ad33b03-66ea-494b-be70-9b076d0dd0c9.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"981a6c15-bcfa-41cc-a651-9331f507337f.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026j6rLjrbX751789634695.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"981a6c15-bcfa-41cc-a651-9331f507337f.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_259fbd53dfbcc898-1193\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>影片與相片曝光後，一眾網民紛紛被俞可程自然健康的氣質與 Fit 爆身形所吸引，紛紛留言大讚：「身材太好了吧，簡直係女神！」、「健康又性感」、「完美女友！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_259fbd53dfbcc898-1193\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5d2190fc-512a-46d8-9467-116402cd7356.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026giOOawfocB1789634694.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5d2190fc-512a-46d8-9467-116402cd7356.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T09:21:05.665931+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":324,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}